# Performance Efficiency Pillar AWS Well-Architected Framework

> This whitepaper focuses on the performance efficiency pillar of the AWS Well-Architected Framework. It provides guidance to help customers apply best practices in the design, delivery, and maintenance of AWS environments.

- [Abstract and introduction](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/welcome.md)
- [Conclusion](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/conclusion.md)
- [Contributors](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/contributors.md)
- [Further reading](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/further-reading.md)
- [Document revisions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/document-revisions.md)
- [Notices](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/notices.md)
- [AWS Glossary](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/glossary.md)

## [Performance efficiency](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/performance-efficiency.md)

- [Design principles](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/design-principles.md): The following design principles can help you achieve and maintain efficient workloads in the cloud.
- [Definition](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/definition.md): Focus on the following areas to achieve performance efficiency in the cloud.


## [Architecture selection](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/architecture-selection.md)

- [PERF01-BP01 Learn about and understand available cloud services and features](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_understand_cloud_services_and_features.md): Continually learn about and discover available services and configurations that help you make better architectural decisions and improve performance efficiency in your workload architecture.
- [PERF01-BP02 Use guidance from your cloud provider or an appropriate partner to learn about architecture patterns and best practices](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_guidance_architecture_patterns_best_practices.md): Use cloud company resources such as documentation, solutions architects, professional services, or appropriate partners to guide your architectural decisions.
- [PERF01-BP03 Factor cost into architectural decisions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_factor_cost_into_architectural_decisions.md): Factor cost into your architectural decisions to improve resource utilization and performance efficiency of your cloud workload.
- [PERF01-BP04 Evaluate how trade-offs impact customers and architecture efficiency](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_evaluate_trade_offs.md): When evaluating performance-related improvements, determine which choices impact your customers and workload efficiency.
- [PERF01-BP05 Use policies and reference architectures](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_use_policies_and_reference_architectures.md): Use internal policies and existing reference architectures when selecting services and configurations to be more efficient when designing and implementing your workload.
- [PERF01-BP06 Use benchmarking to drive architectural decisions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_use_benchmarking.md): Benchmark the performance of an existing workload to understand how it performs on the cloud and drive architectural decisions based on that data.
- [PERF01-BP07 Use a data-driven approach for architectural choices](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_architecture_use_data_driven_approach.md): Define a clear, data-driven approach for architectural choices to verify that the right cloud services and configurations are used to meet your specific business needs.


## [Compute and hardware](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/compute-and-hardware.md)

- [PERF02-BP01 Select the best compute options for your workload](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_select_best_compute_options.md): Selecting the most appropriate compute option for your workload allows you to improve performance, reduce unnecessary infrastructure costs, and lower the operational efforts required to maintain your workload.
- [PERF02-BP02 Understand the available compute configuration and features](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_understand_compute_configuration_features.md): Understand the available configuration options and features for your compute service to help you provision the right amount of resources and improve performance efficiency.
- [PERF02-BP03 Collect compute-related metrics](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_collect_compute_related_metrics.md): Record and track compute-related metrics to better understand how your compute resources are performing and improve their performance and their utilization.
- [PERF02-BP04 Configure and right-size compute resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_configure_and_right_size_compute_resources.md): Configure and right-size compute resources to match your workload’s performance requirements and avoid under- or over-utilized resources.
- [PERF02-BP05 Scale your compute resources dynamically](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_scale_compute_resources_dynamically.md): Use the elasticity of the cloud to scale your compute resources up or down dynamically to match your needs and avoid over- or under-provisioning capacity for your workload.
- [PERF02-BP06 Use optimized hardware-based compute accelerators](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_compute_hardware_compute_accelerators.md): Use hardware accelerators to perform certain functions more efficiently than CPU-based alternatives.


## [Data management](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/data-management.md)

- [PERF03-BP01 Use a purpose-built data store that best supports your data access and storage requirements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_data_use_purpose_built_data_store.md): Understand data characteristics (like shareable, size, cache size, access patterns, latency, throughput, and persistence of data) to select the right purpose-built data stores (storage or database) for your workload.
- [PERF03-BP02 Evaluate available configuration options for data store](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_data_evaluate_configuration_options_data_store.md): Understand and evaluate the various features and configuration options available for your data stores to optimize storage space and performance for your workload.
- [PERF03-BP03 Collect and record data store performance metrics](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_data_collect_record_data_store_performance_metrics.md): Track and record relevant performance metrics for your data store to understand how your data management solutions are performing.
- [PERF03-BP04 Implement strategies to improve query performance in data store](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_data_implement_strategies_to_improve_query_performance.md): Implement strategies to optimize data and improve data query to enable more scalability and efficient performance for your workload.
- [PERF03-BP05 Implement data access patterns that utilize caching](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_data_access_patterns_caching.md): Implement access patterns that can benefit from caching data for fast retrieval of frequently accessed data.


## [Networking and content delivery](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/networking-and-content-delivery.md)

- [PERF04-BP01 Understand how networking impacts performance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_understand_how_networking_impacts_performance.md): Analyze and understand how network-related decisions impact your workload to provide efficient performance and improved user experience.
- [PERF04-BP02 Evaluate available networking features](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_evaluate_networking_features.md): Evaluate networking features in the cloud that may increase performance.
- [PERF04-BP03 Choose appropriate dedicated connectivity or VPN for your workload](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_choose_appropriate_dedicated_connectivity_or_vpn.md): When hybrid connectivity is required to connect on-premises and cloud resources, provision adequate bandwidth to meet your performance requirements.
- [PERF04-BP04 Use load balancing to distribute traffic across multiple resources](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_load_balancing_distribute_traffic.md): Distribute traffic across multiple resources or services to allow your workload to take advantage of the elasticity that the cloud provides.
- [PERF04-BP05 Choose network protocols to improve performance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_choose_network_protocols_improve_performance.md): Make decisions about protocols for communication between systems and networks based on the impact to the workload’s performance.
- [PERF04-BP06 Choose your workload's location based on network requirements](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_choose_workload_location_network_requirements.md): Evaluate options for resource placement to reduce network latency and improve throughput, providing an optimal user experience by reducing page load and data transfer times.
- [PERF04-BP07 Optimize network configuration based on metrics](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_networking_optimize_network_configuration_based_on_metrics.md): Use collected and analyzed data to make informed decisions about optimizing your network configuration.


## [Process and culture](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/process-and-culture.md)

- [PERF05-BP01 Establish key performance indicators (KPIs) to measure workload health and performance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_establish_key_performance_indicators.md): Identify the KPIs that quantitatively and qualitatively measure workload performance.
- [PERF05-BP02 Use monitoring solutions to understand the areas where performance is most critical](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_use_monitoring_solutions.md): Understand and identify areas where increasing the performance of your workload will have a positive impact on efficiency or customer experience.
- [PERF05-BP03 Define a process to improve workload performance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_workload_performance.md): Define a process to evaluate new services, design patterns, resource types, and configurations as they become available.
- [PERF05-BP04 Load test your workload](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_load_test.md): Load test your workload to verify it can handle production load and identify any performance bottleneck.
- [PERF05-BP05 Use automation to proactively remediate performance-related issues](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_automation_remediate_issues.md): Use key performance indicators (KPIs), combined with monitoring and alerting systems, to proactively address performance-related issues.
- [PERF05-BP06 Keep your workload and services up-to-date](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_keep_workload_and_services_up_to_date.md): Stay up-to-date on new cloud services and features to adopt efficient features, remove issues, and improve the overall performance efficiency of your workload.
- [PERF05-BP07 Review metrics at regular intervals](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/performance-efficiency-pillar/perf_process_culture_review_metrics.md): As part of routine maintenance or in response to events or incidents, review which metrics are collected.


